{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえあ ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前みゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)とメールしよってシメにきたご挨拶(^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいー。\n今日はお仕事のあとで\nまあや・まめちゃん・べびたん・らりん・まいまい・みゅみゅ・とまちゃん・ちま\nとご飯食べた(ω)\n席順で書いたよ。名前は端折るけどわかりますよね？うん\n韓国料理を食しましたよー♪\n美味しかったかもしれない\nうそめっちゃ美味しかった(o>ω<o)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば握手会の第２回受付が始まったらしいですね!\nうははーい握手会だー＼(ω)／\nひめたんメンバーに会いたいから申し込んじゃおっかなー♪♪♪\nとかゆーて。\nゆーわけで握手関連のコメント返しちゃう!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姫ちゃん的にDDってどうなんでしょう・・・応援してていいのかな・・・"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別でひめたん取ったよー！もっといっぱい取った方がいい？笑\n他のメンバー行こうか迷ってるんだよねー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのことちょっとでも気にしてくださってるってだけで嬉しい(ω)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから好きな子は何人でも応援してあげてください!\nそっからひめたん単推しにさせるのがひめたんのお仕事ですから(`・・')どやっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんー(^O^)/名古屋個別とろうと思うんだけど、どんなこと話そう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーどんなこと話そっかなー♪\nそうだよね。聞きたいことは全部ブログで質問しとるもんね。\n何でもいいよ？にらめっこでもしりとりでも指相撲でも何でも!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9枚じゃ少ないかなー？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん握手何回行ったらしつこい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくしつこくないないー\nむしろ何回でもきてほしい!\nだって。だってだってだって。\n寂しいじゃん(*/ω＼*)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会部活で行けなくなっちゃったら怒っちゃう？(;´д｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いちゃうーううぅ('・д・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会当たったので楽しみにしてますね\n緊張せずに喋れるコツとかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しぃなひめたんにいい答えを期待しないでほしいけどー、\nとにかく、自分の妹さんとか兄弟さんと話すときって緊張せんよね!\nそのノリで来てくれたらおっけーだと思う∩^ω^∩★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/im